    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sugarplum Cherry kombucha is&nbsp;a light, ethereal holiday seasonal with sweet, mellow notes of dark cherry and plum, enhanced by a forward vanilla flavor&nbsp;for a festive, lightly sweet winter drink that's great as a float or toast alternative, offering a well-rounded, less acidic taste than many kombuchas due to their careful fermentation process.</span></p>",
